WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.202
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:05.205
The NFL season kicked off
last Thursday night

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:07.240
with a game between
the Kansas City Chiefs

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.441
and the Houston Texans.

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:09.876
And while it was great
to see football again,

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.911
there was a moment that left
many people confused

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:15.615
when fans started booing during
a pregame moment of unity --

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.183
protest against racism.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:20.653
After the incident, one of
the players shared his thoughts.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.088
[ Indistinct conversations ]

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:24.791
-People seem to be confused
about why we did what we did.

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.125
We feel as though,

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:28.194
with everything that's going on
in the world today,

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.062
we couldn't help
but to take a stand.

00:00:30.062 --> 00:00:31.364
We may be athletes,

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.867
but at the end of the day,
we're all human beings.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.935
It was clearly
the right thing to do,

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:38.104
to take a knee against racism.

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:40.306
[ Crowd boos ]

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:44.511
But -- But...we also realize
that taking a stance like that

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:46.946
might have made some people
uncomfortable,

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:51.117
so instead of taking a knee,
from now on,

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:53.286
we will be wearing
"Black Lives Matter" T-shirts.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:55.287
[ Crowd boos ]

00:00:55.287 --> 00:00:58.625
Uh, okay. Um.
That's a no go on the T-shirts.

00:00:58.625 --> 00:00:59.992
Okay, okay.

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:01.260
Instead of a T-shirt,

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.229
we'll be wearing
"Black Lives Matter" bracelets.

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:05.131
[ Crowd booing ]

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.900
Damn! Okay, okay.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.202
I get it --
you guys don't like bracelets.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:12.237
And that's why we will each have
a small sticker

00:01:12.237 --> 00:01:13.339
on the back of our --

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.041
[ Crowd booing ]

00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:17.777
God damn! I really thought
the sticker would work.

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:19.045
Okay. Okay.

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:22.282
How about we wear
"Black Lives Matter" T-shirts --

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:24.150
[ Crowd booing ]

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.686
Well, hear me out first.
Dang! Okay?

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:28.688
So, the "Black Lives Matters"
T-shirts,

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:30.723
but it will be
under our jerseys,

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.625
so you won't be able
to see them,

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:34.460
but we will know that we --

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:35.994
[ Crowd booing ]

00:01:35.994 --> 00:01:38.097
You didn't even see them!

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:40.400
But, okay. How about
"Black Lives Matter" --

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.936
[ Crowd booing ]

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.971
You didn't even let me finish.
"Black Lives" --

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:48.174
[ Crowd booing ]

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:49.708
Hold on.
Let me see something.

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:50.710
Black...

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.578
[ Crowd booing ]

00:01:52.578 --> 00:01:53.880
Black...

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.414
[ Crowd booing ]

00:01:55.414 --> 00:01:57.884
How are you guys gonna boo
any time anything "Black"?

00:01:57.884 --> 00:02:00.686
[ Crowd booing ]

00:02:00.686 --> 00:02:02.988
And you guys sure you didn't
like the bracelet idea?

00:02:02.988 --> 00:02:04.457
-No!
-No!

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:05.858
-Well, that's --
that's unfortunate.

00:02:05.858 --> 00:02:07.893
My wife -- My wife was really
excited about making them.

00:02:07.893 --> 00:02:10.997
Anyways, instead of a knee
or a T-shirt,

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:13.566
we'll just stand in protest
against racism.

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:15.969
[ Crowd boos ]

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:17.136
Wh-- What?!

00:02:17.136 --> 00:02:19.438
At this point,
what do you guys want us to do?!

00:02:19.438 --> 00:02:20.907
We'll just do nothing,

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:25.244
but we'll know and you'll know
it's a stance against racism.

00:02:25.244 --> 00:02:28.314
[ Crowd boos ]

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:30.583
Wait.
Are you guys pro-racism?

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:32.985
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:32.985 --> 00:02:36.589
Oh. That makes sense.
Some of y'all are racist.

